    "## Summary & Conclusions\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrated:\n",
    "- ✓ Constellation geometry comparison (GPS vs LEO)\n",
    "- ✓ Signal visibility and availability analysis\n",
    "- ✓ Cross-layer validation concepts\n",
    "- ✓ Spoofing detection via residual analysis\n",
    "- ✓ Multi-constellation resilience strategies\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Findings:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Complementary Coverage**: LEO provides continuous visibility; GPS provides accurate positioning\n",
    "2. **Spoof Detection**: Cross-layer validation can detect spoofed signals via consistency checks\n",
    "3. **Geometric Diversity**: Combining GPS (high) + LEO (low) orbits provides better geometry\n",
    "4. **Independent Validation**: LEO can verify GPS signals using different physics (Doppler, orbital mechanics)\n",
    "\n",
